[sub_resource type="RoseDialogLine" id="RoseDialogLine_e25be1"]
text = "Six seeds, and you know Sella pays more than Garro. You'll do well. From today you're a Dealer. Every Dealer needs something to protect the goods. A pistol, or a launcher?"
